title: All Blues
key: G
tempo: 138
meter: 6/4
style: jazz

// A twelve-bar blues in six: six beats to the bar, a waltz twice. Four bars
// of the one, two of the four, two of the one, then the five with its
// half-step neighbour above it, and home.
[A]
| G7   | %          | %  | % |
| C7   | %          | G7 | % |
| D7#9 | Eb7#9 D7#9 | G7 | % |
